Let your pet eat a lot of the corpses of former adversaries. (It
doesn't matter if they've been in your inventory before. That's a
myth.) A well-fed pet has less likelihood of wandering off looking for
food. Also, wait for your pet to get close before you leave a room. If
you're too far away, your pet may be trying to get to you but not know
how.

(If you want your pet to fetch for you, you have to give him
treats--tripe or meatballs for dogs and cats--and they do have to have
been in your inventory.)
